            <ArticleTitle>The role of the pain clinic in the management of the terminally ill.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>142-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>There are many nerve-blocking techniques available which may be used to add to the quality of life of the terminally ill either as a supplement to other therapies or to reduce the side effects produced by drug and adjunctive therapies.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
